Cc: devicetree-u79uwXL29TY76Z2rM5mHXA@public.gmane.org, linux-renesas-soc-u79uwXL29TY76Z2rM5mHXA@public.gmane.org, Yoshihiro Shimoda <yoshihiro.shimoda.uh-zM6kxYcvzFBBDgjK7y7TUQ@public.gmane.org>
